      "page_id": "n_aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaadpga",
      "sections": [
        {
          "body": "\nThe wiki of a vault stores readable pages as place nodes: a page, its sections in order and the notes on them. Pages link to each other by id, for example [the item types](cloud:n_aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaadpgb#types-and-bodies).\n\nW58 and its `wiki_pages` table are gone since C0 2.2. Pages export as Markdown, one file per page or a zip per vault.\n\n",
          "head_event": "01M5NKB180005000000000D032",
          "order": 1024,
          "section_id": "n_aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaadsea",
          "updated_seq": 32,
          "author": {
            "kind": "worker",
            "worker": {
